 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{726B4533E539859C}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "I. Situation:"
     m_sContent "<h2>I. Situation</h2>"\
     ""\
     "<b>Time & Weather:</b>"\
     "Time: 12:45"\
     "Weather: Cloudy"\
     ""\
     "<b>Situation:</b>"\
     "Soviets forces has been clashing with the local Mujahideen for the past few months, Soviet Command has issued the order to seize the village on the mountains from the control of the Mujahideen, and try to establish dominance in the mountains themselves."
    }
    GC_Briefing "{D49CB8C950CF6393}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "II. Mission: (Must Read)"
     m_sContent "<h2>II: Mission</h2>"\
     "Move up through the mountain and secure the marked village"\
     ""\
     "Recommended to utilize the BMP-1ZDs to suppress any hostile forces to allow your main body to move."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{F5AB0E708D724536}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "II. Mission: (Must Read)"
     m_sContent "<h2>II: Mission</h2>"\
     "Defend the village from the encroaching soviet forces, utilize the terrain and buildings themselves to deny them their full force."\
     ""\
     "(Shovel digging have been disabled for the most part.)"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_MUJ"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{30F90F82C897C00B}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "III. Sustainment:"
     m_sContent "<h2>III: Sustainment</h2>"\
     "<b>a. SOP Variations</b>"\
     "Dress: Standard Soviet Uniform"\
     "Equipment: Standard Soviet Loadout"\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Logistical Support:</b>"\
     "Replen Plan: None for 24h."\
     "Ammunition: Each man carries his own ammunition."\
     "IPE: Helmets and body armour are to be worn at all times."\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Medical:</b>"\
     "Location: Company Aid Post is to be setup by company medics."\
     "CASEVAC: By foot or with company asset like the Ambulance IF there are any."\
     "Plan: Set up a casualty collection point and extract casualties to this point."\
     "Stretchers: None"\
     "Med Packs: Company medpack carried by company medic."\
     "Morphine: Every soldier carries 1+ stick of morphine."\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Vehicles:</b>"\
     "2x BMP-1ZDs"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{A6BDF493B93ED77D}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "III. Sustainment:"
     m_sContent "<h2>III: Sustainment</h2>"\
     "<b>a. SOP Variations</b>"\
     "Uniform: Strict adherence to friendly Mujahideen clothing. DO NOT put on enemy uniforms.. you'll be shot at sight"\
     "Equipment: Battlefield scavenging is authorized (weapons, ammo, vests)."\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Logistical Support:</b>"\
     "Replen Plan: None for 24h."\
     "Ammunition: Each man carries his own ammunition."\
     "IPE: Helmets and body armour are to be worn at all times if you have them.</i>"\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Medical:</b>"\
     "Location: Platoon Aid Post is to be setup by Platoon medics."\
     "CASEVAC: We have no such luxury"\
     "Plan: .. We have no plan"\
     "Stretchers: None"\
     "Med Packs: Platoon medpack carried by the Platoon medic."\
     "Morphine: Every soldier carries 1+ stick of morphine.</i>"\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Vehicles:</b>"\
     "We have none, our personal vehicles were destroyed in a mortar barrage a yesterday"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_MUJ"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{E3B61836FA2F6174}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "IV. Command & Signals:"
